People models used by Photographic Studio By Bill (Person mask)

selfie_segmentation.tflite   Selfie segmentation (person / not a person), 256 x 256
pose_detection.tflite        BlazePose detector (finds a person from the face and hips)
pose_landmark_full.tflite    BlazePose GHUM 3D, full model: 33 body points and a person mask
selfie_multiclass_256x256.tflite   Multiclass selfie segmentation: background, hair, body skin, face skin, clothes,
                             others (accessories). Model card dated May 10, 2023, "Licensed under Apache License,
                             Version 2.0". Downloaded by the user from Google's MediaPipe model page
                             (storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/image_segmenter/selfie_multiclass_256x256/...).

