Apache 2.0), folders mediapipe/modules/selfie_segmentation, pose_detection and pose_landmark; the multiclass model
from Google's MediaPipe model download page.

Model cards / papers:
  Bazarevsky, Grishchenko, Raveendran, Zhu, Zhang, Grundmann, "BlazePose: On-device Real-time Body Pose tracking",
  CVPR Workshop on Computer Vision for AR/VR 2020 (arXiv 2006.10204).
  MediaPipe Selfie Segmentation model card (Google, Apache 2.0).

They are run by the Studio's own NumPy code (studio/engine/local/tinynet.py, GPL-3.0); TensorFlow is not used.
